.*
.* WRKWTR: the printers and their writers. View 1 is the V7R1M0
.* capture's (golden/verified/oracle71/panels): the file a writer is
.* printing; view 2 its output queue and how many files it printed.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 4'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SEPCL BASETYPE='CHAR 5'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=CNTCL BASETYPE='ZONED 5 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VIEWCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=WRITER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DEVICE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=STATUS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=SEP CLASS=SEPCL.
:VAR NAME=FORMTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=FILE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=USER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=USRDTA CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OUTQ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=LIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PRINTED CLASS=CNTCL.
:VAR NAME=WVIEW CLASS=VIEWCL VALUE='1'.
:COND NAME=VIEW1 EXPR='&WVIEW. EQ "1"'.
:COND NAME=VIEW2 EXPR='&WVIEW. EQ "2"'.
:LISTDEF NAME=WRITERS VARS='OPT WRITER DEVICE STATUS SEP FORMTYPE FILE USER USRDTA OUTQ LIB PRINTED'.
:KEYL NAME=WTRKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW1.F11=View 2
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=VIEW2.F11=View 1
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=F24 ACTION=MOREKEYS.F24=More keys
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKWTR KEYL=WTRKEYS HELP=WRKWTR ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with All Printers
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=WRITERS VIEWS=2.(No printers)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?STRPRTWTR DEV(&DEVICE.)'.1=Start
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGWTR WTR(&WRITER.)'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=3 ENTER='CMD HLDWTR WTR(&WRITER.)'.3=Hold
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD ?ENDWTR WTR(&WRITER.)'.4=End
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD WRKWTR WTR(&WRITER.)'.5=Work with
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='CMD RLSWTR WTR(&WRITER.)'.6=Release
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='CMD DSPMSG'.7=Display messages
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD WRKOUTQ OUTQ(&LIB./&OUTQ.)'.8=Work with output queue
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=DEVICE USAGE=OUTPUT.Device
:LISTCOL VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT.Sts
:LISTCOL VAR=SEP USAGE=OUTPUT.Sep
:LISTCOL VAR=FORMTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Form Type
:LISTCOL VAR=FILE USAGE=OUTPUT.File
:LISTCOL VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.User
:LISTCOL VAR=USRDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.User Data
:LISTCOL VAR=WRITER USAGE=OUTPUT.Writer
:LISTCOL VAR=OUTQ USAGE=OUTPUT.Output Queue
:LISTCOL VAR=LIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=PRINTED USAGE=OUTPUT.Printed
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT DEVICE STATUS SEP FORMTYPE FILE USER USRDTA'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT DEVICE STATUS WRITER OUTQ LIB PRINTED'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters for options 1, 2, 3, 4, 6 or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKWTR.Work with Printers - Help
:P.The printers with a writer started: what each is printing now, and
with F11 the output queue it takes files from and how many it has
printed.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
